Detector: divide-before-multiply
LootEther.sell(uint256) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_100_SC05.sol#256-282) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- _dividends = SafeMath.div(SafeMath.mul(_ethereum,exitFee_),100) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_100_SC05.sol#263)
	- profitPerShare_ = SafeMath.add(profitPerShare_,(_dividends * magnitude) / tokenSupply_) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_100_SC05.sol#277)
LootEther.purchaseTokens(uint256,address) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_100_SC05.sol#527-607) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- _undividedDividends = SafeMath.div(SafeMath.mul(_incomingEthereum,entryFee_),100) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_100_SC05.sol#534)
	- _referralBonus = SafeMath.div(SafeMath.mul(_undividedDividends,refferalFee_),100) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_100_SC05.sol#535)
LootEther.purchaseTokens(uint256,address) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_100_SC05.sol#527-607) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- _fee = _fee - (_fee - (_amountOfTokens * (_dividends * magnitude / (tokenSupply_)))) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_100_SC05.sol#588)
LootEther.tokensToEthereum_(uint256) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_100_SC05.sol#649-671) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- _etherReceived = (SafeMath.sub((((tokenPriceInitial_ + (tokenPriceIncremental_ * (_tokenSupply / 1e18))) - tokenPriceIncremental_) * (tokens_ - 1e18)),(tokenPriceIncremental_ * ((tokens_ ** 2 - tokens_) / 1e18)) / 2) / 1e18) (contracts/vulnerable/vuln_100_SC05.sol#657-669)
